# ShapedArt: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_ShapedArt.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py /usr/share/pixmaps/archlinux-logo.png &
wait 2
ipc panels open nowPlaying IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot cookie
note playing: the art is a nine-scalloped cookie
setup playerctl pause
wait 1
shot square
note paused: a 16 px-cornered square (crossfade ~300 ms)
